  "note": "Both verb keys index the same eight occurrences. Exodus connects the verb directly with the stubble noun, while Zephaniah applies it to people. The Arabic collecting verb with ṯ and the straw noun with š need separate evaluation. Bow and archer, indexed here, are covered under קשת."
